<title>HONG KONG: IBA signs HK$1.05 billion FRCD issue.</title>
<headline>IBA signs HK$1.05 billion FRCD issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Bank of Asia Ltd (IBA) said it signed a HK$1.05 billion multi-currency floating-rate certificate of deposit (FRCD) issue on Monday.</p>
<p>The FRCD issue matures in 2000 and is the first issue under IBA's HK$2 billion certificate of deposit issuance programme signed in January.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
